      "F5": "Alfuzosin is the suspected cause of liver injury, making it more likely to be DILI",
      "F6": "The symptoms of loss of appetite, malaise, generalized pruritus, dark urine, and jaundice are consistent with DILI, particularly given the recent start of Alfuzosin"
